  'Recent move': c('Build one anchor in the new place', 'Choose one person or useful place to get to know at school.', ['Find where to ask practical questions.', 'Keep one connection from your previous home if helpful.', 'Try a low-pressure activity that fits your interests.'], 'Find the name of your counselor or advisor.', 'A school counselor, advisor, or peer mentor', ['cdc-connection'], 'support'),
